{"type":"message","id":"1058e304","parentId":"8fe13aa5","timestamp":"2026-05-05T11:45:37.166Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to run the crypto news pipeline. According to my SOUL.md, when triggered with \"run pipeline\" or \"run crypto news pipeline\", I should execute the 5-step pipeline:\n\n1. Research - Clear researcher session and run the research agent\n2. Write - Clear writer session and run the writing agent\n3. Generate Image - Clear creator session and run the image generation\n4. Publish - Clear publisher session and upload to Google Drive\n5. Final Report + Confirmation Gate - Ask user about WordPress\n\nLet me start with Step 1 - Research. I need to:\n1. Clear the researcher session\n2. Run the research agent with the proper command\n\nThe user said \"get me latest crypto news\" which is effectively triggering the pipeline.\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n<thinking>\nThe user wants me to run the crypto news pipeline. I need to follow my SOUL.md instructions exactly.\n\nCurrent step: Step 1 — Research\n\nI need to:\n1. Clear the researcher session\n2. Run the research agent command\n3. Save the JSON output as RESEARCH_JSON\n4. Tell the user \"✅ Research done, starting article...\"\n</thinking>\n\nTriggering the crypto news pipeline now.\n\n**Step 1 — Research**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tooluse_JXm01boWnAZMYA67xXpfMV","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"rm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/researcher/sessions/sessions.json && openclaw agent --agent researcher --message \"Follow your SOUL to cross-reference multiple RSS feeds, find the single biggest news event, and extract deep facts. Return the aggregated Single-Topic JSON.\" --deliver 2>&1","yieldMs":120000}},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"bedrock-converse-stream","provider":"amazon-bedrock","model":"minimax.minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":11124,"output":350,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":1